			"date": "2026-08-18T01:44:13.148Z",
			"content": "<p>I regretted making the tooltip API wrap targets early on (doesn’t work well because components can’t be renderless in HTML).</p>\n<p>Don’t remember all the reasons for the decision off the top of my head, but many folks had problems with stacking context/z-index which couldn’t be resolved without hoisting.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
