			"date": "2026-08-18T12:31:58.931Z",
			"content": "<p>Not an aversion per se. DOM ids are not for free (ie. every ID is a global JS var). It's probably not a big deal nowadays  But old habits ;)</p>\n<p>It's mostly the cost for migrating to web awesome that holds us back. Small open source team. The churn will be huge and not much benefit tbh</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
